§ `ss 5N, 5O, 5P -- obvious and inherent risks`

#ASSERT `Am I presumed aware of the risk` `a mountain-bike crash on a commercial trail` TRUE FALSE

#ASSERT `Did they have to warn me` `a mountain-bike crash on a commercial trail` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `no duty to warn me of an obvious risk (s 5O)`
#ASSERT `Did they have to warn me` `a mountain-bike crash on a commercial trail` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `s 5O does not take away a duty to warn; the general law decides`

